Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: hierarchical_probe (ADR 0025)
Purpose:
    Probe whether sampling the post-autonomous RSet with meta-R
    edges included surfaces genuinely new (hierarchical) structural
    patterns, or merely encoding artifacts of the three-shape
    naming encoding.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0025 (DiscoveryConfig::include_meta_in_discovery,
    RSet::all_edges_sorted; discover_motifs branched on the flag).
    Runner: v2/examples/hierarchical_probe.rs.

====================================================================
RAW OUTPUT
====================================================================

